hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"504","Abd al-Rahman ibn Muhammad ibn Sallam ne hamen bayan kiya, Hajjaj ibn Muhammad ne hamen bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi al-Zinad se, Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz ibn Wuhayb se, Main ne Kharijah ibn Zayd ko kehte hue suna: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) apni majlis mein tamam logon se zyada bawaqar the, Aap apne a'za mein se kisi cheez ko taqreeban bahar na nikalte the."
"505","Hamein Hannad ibn al-Sari ne bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak se, al-Awzai se, Urwah ibn Ruwaym se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Sab se pehli cheez jis se mere Rab ne mujhe buton ki ibadat ke baad mana farmaya woh sharab noshi aur aadmiyon se jhagadna hai."
"506","Hamein Hannad ibn al-Sari ne bayan kiya, hamein Abthar ne bayan kiya, Mutarrif se, Abu al-Safar se, Ali ibn Rabiah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Makkah fatah kiya to Aap fauran Taif ki taraf rawana hue aur Hazrat Abu Bakr Aap ke saath the aur Said ibn al-Aas ke dono bete bhi un ke saath the, Hazrat Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ye kis ki qabr hai? Unhon ne kaha: Said ibn al-Aas ki qabr hai, Hazrat Abu Bakr ne kaha: Allah is qabr wale par laanat farmaye kyunke woh Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki mukhalifat karta tha, to Said ke dono beton ne kaha: Allah Abu Quhafah par laanat farmaye kyunke woh na mehman ki khatir karta tha aur na ruswai se bachata tha, to Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Murdon ko bura kehna zindon ko naraaz karta hai, pas jab tum mushrikon ko bura kaho to un sab ko ikattha bura kaho."
"507","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Ali ne bayan kiya, hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne bayan kiya, Dawud ibn Abi Hind se, al-Abbas ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Hazrat Abbas ke paas aaya aur kaha: Banu Sahm ki kahina al-Ghaytalah ka kya haal hai jo Abd al-Muttalib ke saath Aag mein hai? To Hazrat Abbas ne us ki naak par maara, phir woh Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaye to Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ko kya hai ke woh apne bhai ko kisi muamle mein takleef deta hai agarche woh haq hi ho?"
"508","Hamein Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ne bayan kiya, hamein Yahya yani Ibn Said ne bayan kiya, Ali ibn Husayn se, ke Abdullah ibn Ubayy ne kaha: Agar hum Madinah ki taraf laute to izzat wala zaroor zaleel ko wahan se nikaal dega, aur ye Tabuk ki muhim mein hua, unhon ne kaha: Aur logon mein se aakhri log abhi utre bhi na the, to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kooch karo, kooch karo, to Hazrat Umar ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya hum us ki qaum ke kisi aadmi ko hukm na dein ke us ki gardan maar de? To Aap ne farmaya: Main napasand karta hun ke us ki wajah se woh naraaz ho jis ka naraaz hona main nahi chahta."
"509","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud al-Mahri ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne khabar di, mujhe al-Walid ibn al-Mughirah ne khabar di, al-Harith ibn Yazid al-Hadrami se, unhon ne hadith ko Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) tak marfu kiya, Aap ne farmaya: Apne halqon ko seedha karo, kyunke jab farishte baithne ke liye aate hain aur us mein tedh dekhte hain to wapas laut jaate hain."
"510","Hamein Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Waki ne bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Tariq se, al-Shabi se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas kisi qaum ka shareef aadmi aaye to us ki izzat karo, Imam Abu Dawud ne farmaya: Ye muttasil sanad se bhi riwayat ki gayi hai lekin ye kuch nahi."
"511","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Muadh ne bayan kiya, hamein mere walid ne bayan kiya, hamein Shubah ne bayan kiya, Sad yani Ibn Ibrahim se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab do aadmi hon to teesra un dono ke qareeb na jaye yahan tak ke un dono se ijazat le le."
"512","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne khabar di, mujhe Abd al-Ala ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Farwah ne khabar di, al-Muttalib ibn Abdullah ibn Hantab se, unhon ne kaha: Maine suna ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi aur us ke walid ke darmiyan judai nahi ki jati, main apne ek chacha ke saath baitha tha ke woh aaye to hum ne un ke liye apne darmiyan jagah kushada ki, to Abd al-Ala ne kaha: Ye to mere chacha hain, unhon ne kaha: Haan, chacha Allah ki Kitab mein walid hai."
"513","Abu Salih al-Antaki ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne humein khabar di, Sufyan se, Muhammad ibn Juhadah se, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) mehaz ilzam par kisi ko na pakarte the aur na kisi ke muqable mein kisi ki baat tasleem karte the."
